<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: A loose confederation of pirate gangs who've agreed to mostly fight outsiders instead of fighting each other.
Pirates don't sow, they don't build, and they rarely trade. Driven by a blood-and-honor culture that values personal strength and ruthlessness, they enrich themselves by raiding and robbing their more productive neighbors.
Junkers utilise warcasket technology and seal themselves in metal tombs in which they raid, steal, plunder and inevitably die. They rarely use melee weapons and prefer to keep at distance to the enemy to fully utilise the powerful warcasket weaponry.-->
  <VFEP_Junkers.description>一个由海盗团伙组成的松散联盟，他们同意主要与外来者战斗，而不是互相战斗。
海盗不播种，不建造，也很少进行贸易。在重视个人力量和残酷的血腥和荣誉文化的驱使下，他们通过袭击和抢劫生产力更高的邻居来充实自己。
容克人利用战棺技术，将自己封闭在金属坟墓中，在其中袭击、偷窃、掠夺，最终不可避免地死亡。他们很少使用近战武器，更喜欢与敌人保持距离，以充分利用强大的战匣武器。</VFEP_Junkers.description>
  <!--EN: junkers-->
  <VFEP_Junkers.label>容克斯</VFEP_Junkers.label>
  <!--EN: khan-->
  <VFEP_Junkers.leaderTitle>可汗</VFEP_Junkers.leaderTitle>
  <!--EN: junker-->
  <VFEP_Junkers.pawnSingular>容克</VFEP_Junkers.pawnSingular>
  <!--EN: junkers-->
  <VFEP_Junkers.pawnsPlural>容克斯</VFEP_Junkers.pawnsPlural>
  <!--EN: A paramilitary organisation sanctioned and governed by political figures and megacorporations.
Mercenaries don't sow, they don't build, and they rarely trade. Driven by a blood-and-honor culture that values personal strength and ruthlessness, they enrich themselves by raiding and robbing their more productive neighbors.
Mercenaries utilise spacer-tech weapons and armors to eliminate the targets of their corporate overlords. Unlike other pirate factions, mercenaries can be communicated with and befriended, but they rarely have much to offer in regards to trade and research.-->
  <VFEP_Mercenaries.description>受政治人物和大型企业批准和管理的准军事组织。
雇佣兵不播种，不建设，也很少进行贸易。在重视个人力量和残酷的血腥与荣誉文化的驱使下，他们通过袭击和抢劫生产力更高的邻居来充实自己。
雇佣兵利用太空技术武器和装甲来消灭企业霸主的目标。与其他海盗派系不同，雇佣兵可以与他们交流并成为朋友，但他们在贸易和研究方面很少提供太多帮助。</VFEP_Mercenaries.description>
  <!--EN: mercenaries-->
  <VFEP_Mercenaries.label>雇佣兵</VFEP_Mercenaries.label>
  <!--EN: general-->
  <VFEP_Mercenaries.leaderTitle>一般的</VFEP_Mercenaries.leaderTitle>
  <!--EN: mercenary-->
  <VFEP_Mercenaries.pawnSingular>雇佣兵</VFEP_Mercenaries.pawnSingular>
  <!--EN: mercenaries-->
  <VFEP_Mercenaries.pawnsPlural>雇佣兵</VFEP_Mercenaries.pawnsPlural>
